  "body": "I'd like to see a standardized way to store local user remarks (client-side display aliases) in Matrix, allowing users to assign custom names to contacts or rooms without modifying server-side  display_name  data. Similar features exist in other platforms:\n\n - XMPP\n - Telegram\n - Signal\n - Wechat\n\nSecret storage can be utilised: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.14/client-server-api/#secrets\n",
